    <div class="story__content">
      <h2 class="story__title" data-i18n="story.0.title">Improvised</h2>
      <p class="story__text" data-i18n="story.0.text.0">
        The engraver was built from salvaged optical-drive mechanics, which made it an affordable way to
 learn how stepper motion, guides, backlash, and frame stiffness interact.
      </p>
      <p class="story__text" data-i18n="story.0.text.1">
        It was not about creating a production machine. It was about making a limited set of parts
 move predictably enough to engrave, while learning from every step.
      </p>
    </div>
